# Every static asset carries HSTS. Responses the Worker builds (src/worker/) set it themselves,
# because Cloudflare applies this file only to what the asset layer serves directly.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

# Markdown carries curly quotes and arrows, so it says it is UTF-8 and a browser shows it as written.
/*.md
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8

# The home page names its Markdown twin (src/lib/page-markdown.mjs) for an agent that reads headers first.
/
  Link: </index.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown"
